ype":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1998-keichiokami","name":"Keichiokami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1998_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T10:38:29-08:00","id":796896,"title":"","content":"MattBoggan helped keep me accurate back when I was a teenager and played a Scathach Sidhe French WWII Resitance Fighter in our Journey to Atlantis PbP Forum Chronicle. ^_^<br /> That Chronicle drove my character crazy as everyone kept looking to my character for Leadership and I had to keep reminding them &quot;No! I am a commoner just like you! We are all equals here!&quot; It was a hilarious and awesome adventure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>May you live in interesting times...</i><br /> <br /> Storyteller of <b><a href=\"https://sunforgedoath.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Sun Forged Oath</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1998-keichiokami","name":"Keichiokami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1998_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T11:23:44-08:00","id":796921,"title":"","content":"Really? I did? I don't remember it. And I didn't play this PbP chronicle... I played in one, once, but I don't think it was this one.<br /> <br /> Aaaah, anyway: heureux de vous retrouver tous les amis !","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3747-mattboggan","name":"mattboggan","avatar"