ggan, Matt, is presently answering the call, though you don't seem to remember me... Aaaah. Maybe this roll-call will spark old memories back to life:<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=1015081405181895&amp;l=70480ab5cc\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?f...5&amp;l=70480ab5cc</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Look at that, my memory failed me. Seems like I had the handle Krister back then. Could've sworn I used my standard one. Ah, well!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Krister M. Michl</b> <hr /><b>Freelance writer</b> <hr /><a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Krister_M._Michl\" target=\"_blank\">Entry on White Wolf Wikipedia</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2494-rigistrade","name":"Rigistrade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2494_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T17:12:12-08:00","id":797084,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>beccatoria</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/783830-old-changeling-forum-roll-call?p=796934#post796934\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey guys! I used to hang out on the old WoD Changeling forum too - same name. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" c